      <div type="clause" n="3.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 3.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Forðam to soðe to secge . oferho|gie he . oððe forgyme ða ðing tobegan|ne 7 to bewitanne ðe to scipene oððe to odene be limpað . sona hit wyrð on ber|ne þæt to ðam belimpað.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Because to speak truthfully, if he is too proud or he neglects things which are to be done and attended to, that which belongs in the cattle-shed or to the threshing floor, will soon turn up in the barn.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[3.1] Forðam to soðe ic secge: oferhogie he oððe forgyme ða ðing to beganne 7 to bewitanne, ðe to scipene oððe to odene belimpað, sona hit wyrð on berne þæt to ðam belimpað.</ab>
      </div>
